  "instruction": "Use the NIH Clinical Center Patient Handbook open in Microsoft Edge. A patient family will arrive by car at 10:30 pm. Create a Sticky Note that records the vehicle entrance they should use at that time, the hours that entrance is used, and its location on Rockville Pike.",
  "source": "https://www.cc.nih.gov/sites/default/files/internet-files/participate/_pdf/pthandbook.pdf",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Find the Patient Entry section of the NIH Clinical Center Patient Handbook.",
    "Note that the regular West Drive-Main Patient/Family Entrance is open daily from 6 am to 10 pm.",
    "Because the arrival is at 10:30 pm, identify the after-hours vehicle entrance as the Commercial Vehicle Inspection Facility (CVIF).",
    "Record its hours as 10 pm to 6 am and its location on Rockville Pike (Route 355) between North Drive and Wilson Drive.",
    "Create a Sticky Note with the entrance, hours, and location."
